 \"trigram\". Larger sizes are sometimes referred to by the value of n, e.g., \"four-gram\", \"five-gram\", and so on.","topics":[],"score":213534,"global_rank":258061},{"name":"raymond-devries/skagit60-scraping","owner":"raymond-devries","html_url":"https://github.com/raymond-devries/skagit60-scraping","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":3,"language":"Python","description":"I used these scripts to gather data for skagit60.com. ","topics":[],"score":213528,"global_rank":258078}]